sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Cache as Redis
  participant DB as Database
  Note over App,DB: Read
  App->>Cache: GET product:42
  alt hit
    Cache-->>App: value
  else miss
    Cache-->>App: nil
    App->>DB: SELECT … WHERE id = 42
    DB-->>App: row
    App->>Cache: SET product:42 value EX 600
  end
  Note over App,DB: Write
  App->>DB: UPDATE … (commit)
  App->>Cache: DEL product:42
